-- New stories: 3 United Kingdom stories covering the Autumn Budget
-- 2025 mandate confirmation, the June 2026 Peppol network confirmation,
-- and the genuinely open design questions still pending ahead of the
-- Budget 2026 implementation roadmap. First stories for the UK,
